      "NeedsCompilation": "no",
      "Author": "Richard Iannone [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3925-190X>), Posit Software, PBC [cph, fnd]",
      "Maintainer": "Richard Iannone <rich@posit.co>",
